# D-FREED-INODE-HOME-NEVER-PUBLISHED-LIVE-CORE-AFTER-CLEAN-UNMOUNT, H-F13, on
# the disk-locking transport.  Hypothesis, build (53A7F8EBBCEC0C4B6A705D2),
# knob, settings, measures and VERDICT RULES are those of
# tests/queues/ialloc_fence_ab.queue, written before the first lap of either
# queue; only the configuration (2/disk/caw/direct g2b, test15 test16, where
# pha2 and pha3 measured the exposure) and the labels differ.  The two queues
# are judged separately, each by those rules.
#
# Bound: fucd2's, 1680 s per lap (pha's laps 466-478 s).
1680 MXFS_SNAPSHOT_DIR=/mxfs/snapshots NG0_IALLOC_FENCE=0 NG0_PEER_UNLINK=300 NG0_DRAIN_BOUND=0 NG0_PUBCLAIM_GUARD=1 NG0_PUBCLAIM_DELAY_MS=200 NG0_CREATE_PARENT_DELAY_MS=5 NG0_SELFCLOBBER_GUARD=1 NG0_MIRROR_CHECK=1 NG0_RECYCLE_GUARD=1 NG0_FRESHSRC_GUARD=1 NG0_DELAY_MS=0 NG0_IFREE_DRAIN=1 NG0_IFREE_REAP=1 tests/noino_gen0_ab.sh icc1 1 300 2/disk/caw/direct g2b
